  VehicleCommandCenter is the orchestrator of the Vehicle-Commands page. The native
  surface reproduces its data, composition, every state, and i18n keys via shared
  P1/S8 state-holder seams (no view I/O):

  Composition (web → native):
   - Vehicle header: name (web `display_name || vin`) + lifecycle Badge + freshness
     chip (web FreshnessIndicator) + model·VIN sub-line + live telemetry stat row
     (battery % / rated range / inside temp) with the EXACT web fmtNumber +
     convertDistanceFromSI / convertTempFromSI math, converted at the render boundary
     (web useUnits) — SI in, display unit out.
   - Status feedback panel (web `lastResult`), asleep banner (web `isAsleep`), stale
     banner (web `commands.staleData`), command-status query error banner (retry).
   - Search box (web CommandSearch) driving the client-side filter (web
     `filteredCommands` memo: label / category / command token contains).
   - Favorites bar (web FavoritesBar, localStorage-backed) + collapsible category
     groups (web CollapsibleCommandGroup) of command tiles.
   - Command tiles (web CommandTile / ToggleCommandTile / InputCommandTile): icon ↔
     spinner, favorite star, danger affordance, label/sublabel, bound on/off toggle
     state, last-status line (web `cmdStatus` → timeAgo, ✓/✗).
   - Input / Select / Confirm command dialogs (web CommandInputDialog /
     CommandSelectDialog / CommandConfirmDialog) with the web buildParams / transform
     param assembly reproduced declaratively (single / duplicate / latLon / navAddress
     / vehicleName + raw / intParse / minutesToSeconds / trim), incl. the nested
     navigation share-content payload and the dangerous-confirm countdown + typed
     confirmation (ERASE).
   - Full 67-entry command catalog across 14 categories ported VERBATIM from
     commands.ts (command tokens, base params, schedule payloads, dialog copy).

  Seams (P1/S8): VehicleCommandSource (vehicle + state + latest-status stream +
