=== STATES (every state renders — no hidden surfaces) ===
  loading ......... initial pre-snapshot skeleton chrome (header + tile-grid skeletons)
  content ......... full composition once a vehicle snapshot is present
  empty ........... search with no matches → "No commands match your search" (web
                    commands.search.noResults); favorites-empty → friendly hint
  error ........... command-status query failure → retryable error banner
  stale ........... freshness > 120s → amber freshness chip + commands.staleData banner
                    + one guarded auto-refresh
  offline/asleep .. vehicle asleep/offline → wake-first banner + cached values
  feedback ........ last command success/failure inline banner + toast seam
  Each has a #if DEBUG preview and a model/adapter/render test (EXECUTED green).

